---
layout: base.njk
pageKey: home
permalink: index.html
---
<section class="hero">
  <div class="wrap">
    <h1>{{ pages.home.heading }}</h1>
    <p class="lede">{{ pages.home.intro }}</p>
    <ul class="meta">
      <li>{{ site.location }}</li>
      <li>{{ site.days }}</li>
      <li>Daytime &amp; evening</li>
      <li>{{ lessons.adult.price }} per hour</li>
      <li>First lesson {{ lessons.first.price }}</li>
    </ul>
    <div class="btn-row">
      <a class="btn" href="book.html">Book a first lesson</a>
      <a class="btn ghost" href="adults.html">What a lesson is like</a>
    </div>
    <p class="reassure">&ldquo;Haven&rsquo;t played in twenty years? That&rsquo;s most of my students.&rdquo;</p>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="tight">
  <div class="wrap narrow">
    {% set video_url = videos.welcome %}{% set video_title = "Video 1 &mdash; The Welcome" %}{% set video_note = "60&ndash;90s, face to camera at the piano. The highest-converting asset on the site. See VIDEO-BRIEF.md." %}
    {% include "partials/video.njk" %}
  </div>
</section>

<section class="band">
  <div class="wrap">
    <h2>Most people who contact me start with an apology.</h2>
    <p class="lede">They haven&rsquo;t played since school. They think they&rsquo;ve left it too late. They&rsquo;re worried about wasting a professional&rsquo;s time.</p>
    <p class="lede">None of that is a problem. It&rsquo;s just what starting looks like.</p>
    <ul class="nots">
      <li>No exams, unless you actually want one.</li>
      <li>No scales for the sake of scales.</li>
      <li>No recitals.</li>
      <li>No requirement to read music.</li>
      <li>No being told off for not practising enough.</li>
    </ul>
  </div>
</section>

<section>
  <div class="wrap">
    <h2>How it actually works</h2>
    <div class="grid g3">
      <div class="card">
        <span class="num">One</span>
        <h3>We find out what you want to play</h3>
        <p>A song, a style, an old piece you never finished. That&rsquo;s the target, and everything we do points at it.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="card">
        <span class="num">Two</span>
        <h3>We start with chords</h3>
        <p>Not five years of notation first. Chords mean you&rsquo;re making something that sounds like music in the first few weeks.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="card">
        <span class="num">Three</span>
        <h3>Technique arrives as you need it</h3>
        <p>Reading, theory, fingering &mdash; all of it comes in when it solves a problem you actually have. That way it sticks.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="tight">
  <div class="wrap narrow">
    {% set video_url = videos.first_month %}{% set video_title = "Video 2 &mdash; The First Month Demo" %}{% set video_note = "Three chords, a twelve-bar blues, and some restrained improvising. Proof the promise is real." %}
    {% include "partials/video.njk" %}
    <p class="reassure" style="text-align:center">Three chords. Most adult students are playing this inside about a month.</p>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="band">
  <div class="wrap">
    <h2>I play jazz for a living</h2>
    <div class="grid g2">
      <div>
        {% prose "home-jazz" %}
        <p><a href="about.html">More about me &rarr;</a></p>
      </div>
      {% set video_url = videos.playing %}{% set video_title = "Video 3 &mdash; Him Playing" %}{% set video_note = "One take, no talking. A standard, played beautifully. Deliberately placed <em>below</em> the welcome video." %}
      {% include "partials/video.njk" %}
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section>
  <div class="wrap">
    <h2>What it costs</h2>
    <p class="lede">Published, because you shouldn&rsquo;t have to send an email to find out whether you can afford it.</p>
    <table class="rates">
      <tr><th>Lesson</th><th>Length</th><th>Price</th></tr>
      {%- for key in ["first", "adult", "child", "block"] %}
      {% set lesson = lessons[key] %}{% include "partials/rate-row.njk" %}
      {%- endfor %}
    </table>
    <p style="margin-top:1.5rem"><a href="pricing.html">Full pricing and availability &rarr;</a></p>
  </div>
</section>

{%- set quote = (testimonials | forPage("home"))[0] %}
{%- if quote %}
<section class="band">
  <div class="wrap narrow">
    <blockquote class="pull">
      &ldquo;{{ quote.quote }}&rdquo;
      <cite>{{ quote.name }}</cite>
    </blockquote>
  </div>
</section>
{%- endif %}

<section>
  <div class="wrap">
    <h2>The questions people are too polite to ask</h2>
    <div class="faq">
      {%- for faq in faqs %}
      <details{% if loop.first %} open{% endif %}>
        <summary>{{ faq.question }}</summary>
        <div class="a">{{ faq.answer | md | safe }}</div>
      </details>
      {%- endfor %}
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="band">
  <div class="wrap narrow" style="text-align:center">
    <h2>Come and have a go</h2>
    <p class="lede" style="margin:0 auto">{{ lessons.first.length | replace(" min", " minutes") }}, {{ lessons.first.price }}, no obligation. We&rsquo;ll work out what you want to play and whether we get on.</p>
    <div class="btn-row" style="justify-content:center">
      <a class="btn" href="book.html">Book a first lesson</a>
    </div>
    <p class="reassure">Or text me on {{ site.phone }} &mdash; plenty of people would rather do that.</p>
  </div>
</section>
